492
00:20:12.423 --> 00:20:12.865
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah.

493
00:20:12.865 --> 00:20:14.192
<v GAUTHIA>That was embarrassing.

494
00:20:14.192 --> 00:20:15.962
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah I bet so.

495
00:20:15.962 --> 00:20:19.942
<v GAUTHIA>Everybody looking and saying, "[Nassa?] your mama come here."

496
00:20:19.942 --> 00:20:20.385
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah.

497
00:20:20.385 --> 00:20:20.827
Right.

498
00:20:20.827 --> 00:20:23.923
<v GAUTHIA>Yeah, so they meant business back then.

499
00:20:23.923 --> 00:20:24.365
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah.

500
00:20:24.365 --> 00:20:26.577
He must have done something.

501
00:20:26.577 --> 00:20:27.462
That's funny.

502
00:20:27.462 --> 00:20:31.000
<v GAUTHIA>Probably fighting because he was a rascal.

503
00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:31.397
<v DIGILORMO>Okay.

504
00:20:31.397 --> 00:20:35.765
<v GAUTHIA>Mama didn't believe us falling in trouble and stuff like that.

505
00:20:35.765 --> 00:20:36.162
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah.

506
00:20:36.162 --> 00:20:36.956
<v GAUTHIA>My parents.

507
00:20:36.956 --> 00:20:37.353
<v DIGILORMO>Right.

508
00:20:37.353 --> 00:20:42.515
<v GAUTHIA>So they always liked to keep a good rope on us and stuff.

509
00:20:42.515 --> 00:20:48.074
