510
00:20:48.074 --> 00:20:49.662
<v GAUTHIA>Well Sally played basketball.

511
00:20:49.662 --> 00:20:56.015
My youngest brother Alvin wanted to play, but my parents didn't believe in us playing sports.

512
00:20:56.015 --> 00:20:56.412
<v DIGILORMO>Okay.

513
00:20:56.412 --> 00:20:58.000
Why is that?

514
00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:02.756
<v GAUTHIA>Just because they figured you were going to get hurt.

515
00:21:02.756 --> 00:21:03.232
<v DIGILORMO>Okay.

516
00:21:03.232 --> 00:21:04.183
<v GAUTHIA>That's why.

517
00:21:04.183 --> 00:21:12.744
