525
00:21:34.146 --> 00:21:35.098
To go

526
00:21:35.098 --> 00:21:36.049
<c.p>play football.

527
00:21:36.049 --> 00:21:37.000
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah.

528
00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.486
<v GAUTHIA>So that was something.

529
00:21:38.486 --> 00:21:39.600
And look today . . .

530
00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:41.457
<v DIGILORMO>And then he showed y'all.

531
00:21:41.457 --> 00:21:44.800
<v GAUTHIA>He’s using that talent to make a living now.

532
00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:47.400
