533
00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:50.000
My daddy don't remember now, so.

534
00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:50.333
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah.

535
00:21:50.333 --> 00:21:53.667
<v GAUTHIA>But he would have be very extremely proud of him.

536
00:21:53.667 --> 00:21:54.667
<v DIGILORMO>I bet so.

537
00:21:54.667 --> 00:21:55.000
<v GAUTHIA>Yes.

538
00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:55.667
<v DIGILORMO>What team?

