543
00:22:05.667 --> 00:22:08.000
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah I'll have to ask him.

544
00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:11.158
<v GAUTHIA>[Carrie?] Rigmaiden for sure because he used to coach him.

545
00:22:11.158 --> 00:22:11.474
<v DIGILORMO>Wow.

546
00:22:11.474 --> 00:22:11.789
<v GAUTHIA>[Agrees].

