00:22:47.903 --> 00:22:52.097
Was he a coach at Mossville when you went there?

567
00:22:52.097 --> 00:22:52.516
<v GAUTHIA>No.

568
00:22:52.516 --> 00:22:52.935
<v DIGILORMO>Okay.

569
00:22:52.935 --> 00:22:57.548
<v GAUTHIA>No, I think he probably maybe just coached summertime for kids.

570
00:22:57.548 --> 00:22:59.226
<v DIGILORMO>Oh, I got you.

571
00:22:59.226 --> 00:23:00.903
<v GAUTHIA>I might be wrong.

572
00:23:00.903 --> 00:23:02.161
<v DIGILORMO>I got you.

573
00:23:02.161 --> 00:23:03.839
<v GAUTHIA>Might be recreational sports.

574
00:23:03.839 --> 00:23:04.258
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah.

575
00:23:04.258 --> 00:23:07.613
<v GAUTHIA>That's what I said, I don't really remember.

576
