646
00:25:55.286 --> 00:25:55.857
<v DIGILORMO>Okay.

647
00:25:55.857 --> 00:26:02.143
<v GAUTHIA>And he worked until I would say probably in the ‘80s.

648
00:26:02.143 --> 00:26:03.286
<v DIGILORMO>Oh wow.

649
00:26:03.286 --> 00:26:03.857
<v GAUTHIA>Yeah.

650
00:26:03.857 --> 00:26:05.000
<v DIGILORMO>Wow.

