658
00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:22.412
<v DIGILORMO>Okay.

659
00:26:22.412 --> 00:26:24.059
<v GAUTHIA>They all retired there.

660
00:26:24.059 --> 00:26:24.471
<v DIGILORMO>Interesting.

