1477
01:00:51.000 --> 01:00:51.308
<v DIGILORMO>Okay.

1478
01:00:51.308 --> 01:00:55.000
<v GAUTHIA>On Prater Road, so I never had to go buy a house.

1479
01:00:55.000 --> 01:00:59.000
