1484
01:01:06.692 --> 01:01:07.308
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah that's . . .

1485
01:01:07.308 --> 01:01:09.154
<v GAUTHIA>I had good parents, you see.

1486
01:01:09.154 --> 01:01:09.462
<v DIGILORMO>Yeah.

1487
01:01:09.462 --> 01:01:11.000
<v GAUTHIA>So that's how that was.

1488
01:01:11.000 --> 01:01:21.462
