1492
01:01:35.923 --> 01:01:38.385
Because he had nerve problems through the service.

1493
01:01:38.385 --> 01:01:45.462
And he said he wants to be independent and be like most mens that go to work and receive a check like that.

1494
01:01:45.462 --> 01:01:47.615
